     "titulo": "Origin and place",
     "texto": [
      "**Pochodzę z…** expresses origin and takes the genitive; **przeprowadzić się do…** indicates destination and also takes the genitive.",
      "To say which language is spoken, use **po**: **po ukraińsku**, **po polsku**. It is not translated word for word from Spanish."
